  "home": {
    "desc": {
      "da": "Supply Chain Resilience Assessment Tool er udviklet i et projekt finansieret af Industriens Fond (se www.scr-smv.dk) og er udført af forskere fra Syddansk Universitet. Vurderingsværktøjet videreudvikles i et nyt projekt ”Cybersikkerhed og Business Continuity” også finansieret af Industriens Fond (www.cyber-smv.dk).",
      "en": "The Supply Chain Resilience Assessment Tool has been developed in a project funded by the Danish Industry Foundation (see www.scr-smv.dk) and has been carried out by researchers from University of Southern Denmark. The assessment tool is further developed in a new project \"Cybersecurity and Business Continuity\" also funded by the Danish Industry Foundation (www.cyber-smv.dk)."
    }
  },
